  "name": "bootstrap_citizens",
  "description": "Tier-1/2 reference game (balancing pass, golden t) on the dev archipelago from the content starting stock only: a settler town grown house by house from three plank chains, a shipyard and a sloop settling island 2, wool and a chapel for the Citizens unlock, a quarry on the start island's stone deposits for the first Citizen house, and the Settler-staffed tool chain on island 2 (iron deposits) supplied by a route that brings stone and planks out and tools home. The player builds in plan order as soon as gold and materials allow (waiting in whole minutes), keeps planks for the next planned building, and fills the remaining planks with settler houses; no pauses, demolitions or micro-timing.",
